    "name": "Sky: Ascendant (Libra)",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>♎ Libra is ascendant today.</strong> Your Cloth is awake. For the whole day your Techniques heighten as though you were <strong>4 levels higher</strong>, and you have your Ascendant Boon.</p><h3>The Balance</h3><p>You may wield <strong>one weapon from each of two different Arms</strong> at once and gain <strong>both</strong> their Arts; the two count as a matched pair for the <strong>twin</strong> trait. @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-class-features.Item.Summon an Arm] no longer sets down the Arm you were holding, so calling a second one leaves you holding both.</p><p>Your Arms Advance counts as <strong>one tier higher</strong> in both potency and striking &mdash; maximum <strong>+4</strong> and <strong>five damage dice</strong>.</p><p>You gain a <strong>+2 status bonus to all saving throws</strong>, and the first natural 1 you roll each hour counts as a 10.</p><hr /><p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-class-features.Item.Ascendant Constellation]. Applied and removed by the module's sky tracker; a GM can also drag it on by hand.</p>"
        },
